    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">SpendTracker runs fully offline: no login, no account, no analytics, no ads, and no internet permission. Financial SMS bodies are read only to parse a transaction and are never saved. Parsed records live only on this device. To stop scanning, revoke SMS access in system Settings; to remove stored data, use Delete all data above.</string>
